        "id": "frontend-f8---offline-css-selector-ex01-html",
        "title": "selector",
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n    <head>\r\n        <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\r\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\r\n        <title>Document</title>\r\n        <!-- External CSS: tách file riêng -->\r\n        <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./CSS/ex01.css\" />\r\n        <!-- Internal CSS: làm trong file HTML -->\r\n        <style>\r\n            /* Comment CSS */\r\n            .title {\r\n                color: red;\r\n                font-style: italic;\r\n            }\r\n            /* \r\n            Selector {\r\n                property1: value1;\r\n                property2: value2;\r\n                property3: value3;\r\n            } */\r\n        </style>\r\n    </head>\r\n    <body>\r\n        <h1 class=\"title\">Học lập trình</h1>\r\n        <h1 class=\"title2\">Học lập trình</h1>\r\n        <p style=\"background-color: aqua\">\r\n            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur, adipisicing elit. Fuga\r\n            assumenda iste repudiandae odio dolorem commodi laudantium, alias\r\n            dicta ratione accusantium animi libero saepe inventore et est, eum\r\n            iusto quasi accusamus temporibus distinctio nostrum. Tempore\r\n            dolores, harum expedita unde ea placeat! Voluptate veritatis veniam\r\n            ut, laboriosam dolorem magni illum iusto dolor?\r\n        </p>\r\n    </body>\r\n</html>\r\n",
